<title>USA: Motorola shows new voice paging technology.</title>
<headline>Motorola shows new voice paging technology.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc's Advanced Messaging Group said Tuesday it previewed a new voice messaging technology it is making available in Puerto Rico.</p>
<p>The company said it installed its InFLEXion voice messaging network on the island, through an agreement with Amtel de PR, a local service provider.</p>
<p>Motorola said its advanced voice pager allows users to receive stored messages from a pocket-sized, wireless answering machine.</p>
<p>Motorola provides wireless communications, semiconductors and advanced electronic systems and services worldwide.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
